                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-coaching-conversations" class="course-details__heading">Coaching Conversations:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This 4-hour leadership experience equips leaders to elevate performance through high-impact coaching conversations that build trust, reinforce accountability, and address performance gaps with clarity. Leaders strengthen their ability to navigate challenging conversations, reduce defensiveness, and drive behavior change through structured, evidence-based communication. The result is stronger alignment, increased ownership, and more consistent team execution. Leaders leave with practical tools to coach in the moment, address difficult behaviors effectively, and develop higher-performing teams.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-absolute-ownership" class="course-details__heading course-details__heading--leadership">Absolute Ownership:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This leadership experience equips leaders to build a culture of ownership where accountability, communication, and results are fully aligned. Leaders shift from assigning blame to taking responsibility for outcomes, strengthening decision-making, transparency, and team trust. Through practical application, participants learn to eliminate excuses, improve communication clarity, and create environments where individuals take initiative and ownership of performance. Leaders leave with the tools to drive accountability, elevate team standards, and create a culture where results are consistently owned and achieved.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <section class="course-details__pair" aria-labelledby="course-conflict-resolution course-fail-better">
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-conflict-resolution" class="course-details__heading">Conflict Resolution:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This 4-hour leadership experience equips leaders to resolve conflict in a way that drives alignment, strengthens relationships, and accelerates performance. Leaders shift from avoiding or reacting to conflict to addressing it directly with clarity, emotional control, and a focus on solutions. Using a structured conversation model, participants learn to reduce friction, manage difficult dynamics, and turn conflict into forward progress. Leaders leave with practical tools to lead confident, outcome-focused conversations that create accountability, alignment, and measurable results.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-fail-better" class="course-details__heading course-details__heading--leadership">Fail Better:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This 4-hour leadership experience equips leaders to build a high-performance, fail-fast culture where learning velocity drives results. Leaders shift from avoiding failure to using it strategically—making faster, smarter decisions while maintaining accountability and control. Through structured, real-world application and peer-driven problem solving, participants strengthen cross-functional collaboration and apply diverse learning approaches to accelerate execution. The result is a more agile, resilient team capable of turning setbacks into measurable progress. Leaders leave with practical tools to improve decision speed, elevate team performance, and drive consistent, sustainable outcomes.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <section class="course-details__pair" aria-labelledby="course-emotional-intelligence course-motivating-teams">
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-emotional-intelligence" class="course-details__heading">Emotional Intelligence:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This module equips leaders to leverage emotional intelligence to improve decision-making, strengthen relationships, and elevate team performance. Leaders develop greater self-awareness, emotional control, and communication effectiveness to lead through pressure, change, and complex interactions. Through practical application, participants learn to shift from reactive thinking to a solution-focused mindset that drives alignment and results. Leaders leave with the tools to manage emotions with precision, influence outcomes, and lead with clarity, confidence, and consistency.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-motivating-teams" class="course-details__heading course-details__heading--leadership">Motivating High Performing Teams:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This module strengthens leaders to build and sustain high-performing teams through intentional motivation, accountability, and empowerment. Leaders learn to identify the root causes of underperformance, strengthen engagement, and align individual drivers with team and organizational goals. Through practical frameworks, participants enhance their ability to delegate effectively, recognize performance, and create an environment where individuals feel valued and accountable for results. Leaders leave with the tools to increase engagement, improve retention, and consistently drive higher levels of team performance.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <section class="course-details__pair" aria-labelledby="course-growth-mindset course-leadership-blindspots">
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-growth-mindset" class="course-details__heading">Growth Mindset:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This module equips leaders to develop a growth mindset that drives resilience, adaptability, and continuous improvement. Leaders learn to shift from limiting beliefs and fixed thinking to a mindset that embraces challenge, feedback, and learning as a path to higher performance. Through practical reflection and application, participants strengthen their ability to influence team mindset, encourage calculated risk-taking, and build a culture of accountability and progress. Leaders leave with the tools to reframe obstacles, accelerate development, and create teams that consistently learn, adapt, and perform at a higher level.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-leadership-blindspots" class="course-details__heading course-details__heading--leadership">Overcoming Leadership Blindspots:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This leadership experience equips leaders to identify and address blind spots that limit performance, decision-making, and team effectiveness. Leaders strengthen self-awareness by understanding perspectives, leveraging feedback, and uncovering hidden behaviors that impact results. Through structured reflection and practical application, participants learn to reduce ego, respond to feedback with intention, and translate insight into visible behavior change. Leaders leave with the tools to improve self-awareness, strengthen credibility, and lead with greater clarity, accountability, and impact.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <section class="course-details__pair" aria-labelledby="course-presentation-skills course-situational-leadership">
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-presentation-skills" class="course-details__heading">Presentation Skills:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This experience equips leaders to present with clarity, confidence, and impact in high-stakes environments. Leaders strengthen their ability to command a room, communicate with purpose, and engage audiences through structured messaging and effective storytelling. Through practical application, participants improve delivery, manage nervousness, and align verbal and non-verbal communication to ensure credibility and influence. Leaders leave with the tools to deliver presentations that drive alignment, inspire action, and reinforce leadership presence.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-situational-leadership" class="course-details__heading course-details__heading--leadership">Situational Leadership:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>This leadership experience equips leaders to adapt their approach based on the situation, enabling more effective decision-making, stronger team development, and improved organizational results. Leaders strengthen their ability to align strategy with execution through goal setting, planning, prioritization, and measurement frameworks. By applying situational leadership principles, participants learn to balance leadership styles, develop talent intentionally, and make decisions that are both strategic and actionable. Leaders leave with the tools to increase agility, improve performance, and lead with clarity, adaptability, and measurable impact.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <section class="course-details__pair" aria-labelledby="course-simply-said">
                <article class="course-details__track">
                    <h3 id="course-simply-said" class="course-details__heading">Simply Said:</h3>
                    <div class="course-details__prose">
                        <p>Have you been told that you don't listen or that you need to be better at communicating?  This leadership experience equips leaders to communicate with clarity, precision, and impact across diverse teams and situations. Leaders strengthen their ability to adapt communication styles, improve listening effectiveness, and reduce misalignment caused by bias and misinterpretation. Through practical application, participants enhance both verbal and written communication to ensure messages are understood, actionable, and results-driven. Leaders leave with the tools to drive alignment, improve collaboration, and communicate in a way that accelerates execution and performance.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
